data: {"id": "c35ab8352c324da8-thinking-parallel_evidence-2886", "run_id": "c35ab8352c324da8", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 首轮工具结果已采集，开始分析\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Kubernetes 描述 (kubectl_describe)**：\n   - Pod 状态: `Pending` (非 Running)\n   - 容器 `app` 状态: `Waiting`，原因为 `ContainerCreating`\n   - **关键事件**: `Warning FailedMount` - `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`\n   - 该事件已持续约 52 分钟，反复出现 (x33)\n   - Volume `input` 类型: ConfigMap，Name: `unavailable-config`, Optional: `false`\n   - 控制器: `ReplicaSet/workload-5b5fc86c8c`\n   - 节点: `node2/10.2.0.50`\n   - Restart Count: 0\n\n2. **Promethe", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789048158358, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

